  title: Spinoff Ordered Keys
  author: VFlyer
  description: 'Spinoff Ordered Keys ver 1.0.1

    No, this is not the Ordered Keys that you all know and love. It still loves to
    reset on you.

    A collection of 3 Ordered Keys variants developed by VFlyer. This mod contains:

    - Shordered Keys

    - Baby Ordered Keys

    - Kanyeordered Keys (Idea by "Kanye")

    Module IDs

    Shordered Keys: shorderedKeysModule

    Kanyeordered Keys: kanyeorderedKeys

    Baby Ordered Keys: babyOrderedKeysModule


    Ordered Keys Model by Speakingevil

'
